<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia has lower trade deficit to May 97.</title>
<headline>Tunisia has lower trade deficit to May 97.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's trade deficit fell to 935.4 million dinars during the first five months of 1997 from 980.0 million dinars a year earlier, official statistics showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Exports rose 14.6 percent year on year to 2,446 million dinars and imports were up by 8.5 percent to 3,381.4 million dinars. ($=1.0963 dinar)</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
